### How it works

- **Products live in Shopify.** The store reads them with the public Storefront token. A product is visible only if it is **Active and published to the Headless channel**. Pages revalidate every 60 seconds (ISR); saving in the admin panel clears the cache immediately.
- **Categories are Shopify tags** written as `Dimension: Value`: `Type: Press-On Set | Kit | Glue | Tabs | Tools | Remover | Storage`; `Shape: Almond | Coffin | Square | Oval | Squoval | Round | Stiletto`; `Length: Short | Medium | Long`; `Style: French Tip | Nude & Solid | Glitter & Chrome | 3D & Charms`; `Occasion: Halloween | Fall | Holiday | Valentine's | Bridal | Everyday`; `Finish: Glossy | Matte | Chrome`; `Color: ...`. Also the plain tag `Best Seller` (owner-set only, never guessed). "New" is automatic for 30 days. Value lists are in `taxonomy.ts`.
- **Collections are virtual** (generated from tags, no Shopify collections needed): `/store/collections/almond-press-on-nails`, `short-press-on-nails`, `french-tip-press-on-nails`, `halloween-press-on-nails`, `press-on-nails` (all sets), `press-on-nail-glue`, etc. A collection with **0 products returns 404**, with **1 to 5 is `noindex`**, with **6+ is indexed and in the sitemap**. Filters and sorting run **in the browser** on the full list (no filter URLs for Google to crawl; canonical is always the base URL). This answered v1's open question: Search & Discovery is **not** needed.
- **Admin panel `/admin/store`:** login form against `ADMIN_ACCESS_KEY` (httpOnly cookie, key never in the URL). Open a product by pasting its Shopify admin link, store link or handle. Edits write straight back to Shopify: title, description (plain text or HTML), price and compare-at, tags (category buttons), image alt text / remove / main image / add by link, SEO title and meta, Active/Draft, "Show on the store" (publishes to the Headless channel). Bulk bar: add/remove a category on many products, publish/unpublish. **Update sitemap** button. A "Ready to go live?" checklist never blocks saving. Demo mode shows an amber badge.
- **Limits of the panel:** it cannot add/remove/rename variants, cannot upload files from the computer (image by link only; Shopify then hosts it), "Remove" on an image deletes the file from Shopify, the page URL is locked while a product is live, and there is no undo.
- **Product page SEO:** H1 pattern `[Name] – Short Almond Press-On Nails` for sets, canonical to `/store/products/<handle>`, Product JSON-LD with price, availability and shipping details (free, US/GB/CA/AU), **no rating or review markup (none exist)**, BreadcrumbList. Return markup is **deliberately off** (`policy.returns.windowDays = null`). Descriptions are run through an allow-list sanitizer (images stripped).
- **Cart:** Shopify Cart API through `/api/store/cart` with an httpOnly `mirelle_cart` cookie; checkout is Shopify-hosted. A stale/demo cart id is ignored and replaced (a real bug found and fixed).

